<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.9 points to 885.9 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.9 points to 885.9 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 8.9 points on Tuesday to 885.9, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the energy index falling the most, down 22.2 points, or 2.11 percent, to 1,031.6 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
